  "description": "Fuaran.Survey.Sav — a reader for agency survey deliverables in SPSS system-file format (.sav and zlib .zsav, either byte order, all three compression modes). Reads the dictionary losslessly including every extension record (multiple response sets, attributes, roles, display parameters, documents, long string labels and missing values), streams cases in one pass, and writes a dependency-free columnar store for analysis. FSharp.Core only.",
